 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Day parts (`2d`) in `parse`, for example `parse("2d4h")`.
+- `format(ms, { days: true })` renders days, for example `"1d 1h"`. The default
+  output of `format` is unchanged.
+
 ## [1.4.0] - 2026-06-02
 
 ### Added
diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
